# Keep the docker build context lean. Allowlist: nothing from the
# repo is in the docker build context except the pre-staged release
# binaries and the Dockerfile itself.
#
# `**` excludes everything; `!dist` re-includes the directory entry
# so docker's walker descends into it; `!dist/**` re-includes the
# files. Both negations are required — `!dist` alone produces an
# empty directory in the build context, which is exactly the bug
# v0.9.9's first release attempt hit (build context transferred 2B,
# COPY failed with "not found" on every target arch).
**
!dist
!dist/**
!Dockerfile

